-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
PLACEHOLDER -- replace with the output of:
  step certificate inspect --format pem $(step path)/certs/root_ca.crt
after running infra/bootstrap-step-ca.sh. This file is PUBLIC (it's a
certificate, not a key) and is meant to be committed -- it's what lets
IAM Roles Anywhere validate certs signed by your step-ca, and what lets
the registrar Lambda verify TLS when calling step-ca's API.
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
